\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2.8}{\ignorespaces  The RMS error averaged over 100 model runs of length 1000 windows is reported for the EKF for varying additive and multiplicative inflation factors $\Delta $ and $\mu $. Each of the 100 model runs starts with a random IC, and the analysis forecast starts randomly. The filter performance RMS is computed as the RMS value of the difference between forecast and truth at the assimilation window for the latter 500 windows, allowing a spin-up of 500 windows. }}{32}}
\newlabel{fig:EKF_cov_tuning_210s}{{2.8}{32}}
\citation{tippet2003ensemble}
